# Accounts SQLite DB (opt-in, ACCOUNTS_ENABLED=1) — without this, a developer's
# local dev database (registered test accounts, WAL/SHM sidecar files) gets
# baked into the image via `COPY . .`. compose.yml's volume mount shadows it
# at runtime under docker-compose, but a bare `docker run` (or any other
# orchestrator without that same mount) would boot straight off whatever
# happened to be on the build machine's disk at build time.
